# Security and test review reports. These describe not-yet-fixed findings and
# must never reach this public repo. On the 2.0 branch the same rules live in
# .security/.gitignore and .testing/.gitignore; those files are not present on
# this branch, so the rules are repeated here to keep the reports uncommittable
# no matter which branch is checked out.
.security/code-review-report-*.md
.testing/test-review-report-*.md

# LLM
.claude/
